          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa pipö Israel löwïr wölo mi Daudi ompö Epron akïlenchï, “Kïchicha koyeku nko kisönköku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö osis cho kikuwer ato ki pöytoghin Saulö, kintöghoghchini Israel ompö poryot, akiyomisunyi lö, ‘Ilïkunyi mösöwonto piköchan Israel aipöytonyi Israel.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpechï kintöghoghi Israel pöytoghin ompö Epron, kuyomis kegh Daudi nko chane ompö tawu ECHOTYON. Akïkïl chane Daudi kïlïkwï pöytoghinto Israel, kïle ato kiyomis ECHOTYON kuwerï Samwel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 15:63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kir 1:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö Daudi nko pipö Israel löwïr akupokyï Yerusalem, nyoni kï Yepus, nyo kile koro Yepusin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yepusin Daudi, “Memukenyinye ntelïtï korencha, ntelïtï kanasyantencha.” Wölo kïnam Daudi Sayon* akïlïkwï nyoni kanasyanta Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Daudi, “Chi nyo nyoghöy kïpöröy Yepusin kïlïku kintöghoghinto pipö lïk.” Kuntöghoghchï poryot Yoap nyo kile kame Seruya, kïlïkwï nyinte kintöghoghinto pipö lïk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmang Daudi kanasyantanay, akekurö kanasyanta Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtek Daudi kanasyante kuwit kïngeta Milo kutang, kuwanta Yoap kïtek kanasyante wölo kinyara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtasa owesyo Daudi ompöwölo kimi ECHOTYON Tororöt pö lïkos nko nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyökon pö Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chï kï pipö lïk cho le nyökon cho kimi Daudi tïkwïl, cho kingarak nyinte nko pipö Israel atökïlïkwï pöytoghin kïle ato kiyomis ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo pö tagh kï Yasyopeam nyo pö ara Akmon, yetïn nyo pö “Chane cho le sömök,” nyo kipar pich cho le 300 ompö poryot akonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo pö odeny ompö nyökonchay le sömök kï Eleasar wero Dodo nyo pö ara Aoy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi ato kipoyotö nyinte nko Daudi akïporyeghö Pilisti ompö Pas Damim. Kimi chane wölo le para mosong. Kïryögh lïko pipö Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wölo kughyongtö chane nko pikökwa ompö paranoni akïporyeghö pipö Pilisti. Kutö ECHOTYON chane rïntagh nyo wow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïröytö pich cho le sömök ompö kintöghoghichay le tömönut sömök, kutang köpöno Adulam wölo ki mi Daudi ato kirich osiswo ilö akimi lïko Pilisti mpöghoghyo Repaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi Daudi atoni wölo tekate, kïmi pipö Pilisti walaka Petleem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunan Daudi kaw akïlö, “Ntökökonanïn chi pögh cho pö kö pö pögh nyo mi Petleem!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget pïchay kï sömök le nyökon akuwer möngo Pilisti kwen, akïrömunö pögh köyay pö pögh mi Petleem akwipchï Daudi. Wölo melö kigha nyinte kitö ECHOTYON, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïlö, “Mogheghanye chï ECHOTYON, ompöwölo lata ato kagheghan kisön pö pïchï ketö söpöntöngwa tapan.” Kïlenyona kïtagh kïgha. Tïkwïn choni cho echön cho kigh nyökonchay le sömök.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki Apisyay werto ompö Yoap nyo kile yetïn pö pïchay le tömönut sömök. Kipara ngat nyinte pich 300, akwororit ompö chay le tömönut sömök. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyaror nyinte tya ompö pïchay le tömönut sömök akïlïkwï yetïntöngwa, wölo melö kit ororyenyi nyo pö pïchay le sömök.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki chi nyo awes Penaya wero Yeoyada nyo pö Kapseel, akigh nyinte tïkwïn cho pö töngönchin, kipar nyökon pö Moap odeny akïpörchï ngötïny ngötut ompö osiswo kaghïtan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipar tïkwïl chi pö Misri nyo kikogh nyo kitïng ngat ompö eghunyi, wölo kïporyeghö Penaya nyinte ompö lïkïp akïsara ngatït akïpara nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tïkwïn choni cho pö töngonchin cho kigh Penaya wero Yeoyada akwororit ompö pïchay le tömönut sömök. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyoror nyinte ompö kwenungwa, wölo melö kit ororyenyi nyo pö pïchay le sömök, kwigh Daudi nyinte kïlïkwï ripintenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
